{"unit_id":"SeanTolstoyevski__dsh-code-review#card-zh","repo":"SeanTolstoyevski/dsh-code-review","commit":"620b25730106193b8cb8831bf3c4416098c461ac","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-review 是供 DeepSeek Harness Web 使用的代码审查插件。通过 /review 检查工作区未提交的变更或当前会话修改的文件，可选择代码、架构或自定义模式。审查结果以对话卡片呈现，用户可查看并复制发现。适合希望在 DSH 中审阅代码改动的开发者；使用时需要可用的审查模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3014","index.js:3030","client.js:534","index.js:2541"]}
{"unit_id":"SeanTolstoyevski__dsh-code-review#card-en","repo":"SeanTolstoyevski/dsh-code-review","commit":"620b25730106193b8cb8831bf3c4416098c461ac","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-code-review reviews changes in DeepSeek Harness Web. Use /review on uncommitted workspace changes or files edited in the current session, with code, architecture, or custom modes. Findings appear in a conversation card for users to view and copy. An available reviewer model route is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3014","index.js:3030","client.js:534","index.js:2541"]}
